1
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,479
I found the love of my life,

2
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,520
but in an instant,

3
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,280
he was gone again.

4
00:02:50,599 --> 00:02:51,479
He said

5
00:02:51,759 --> 00:02:53,319
he loved this land,

6
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,919
and even joked

7
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:56,879
he'd stay here even in death.

8
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:02,800
I guess he got his wish.

9
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,680
Actually, everyone dies.

10
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,479
True death

11
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,680
is being forgotten.

12
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,960
You should congratulate me.

13
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,520
I've regained all my memories.

14
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,680
This way, the person I love most

15
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,120
can live forever in my heart.

16
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,520
Rosie,

17
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:48,960
I admire you.

18
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,280
We claim

19
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,400
responsibility for the recent bombing.

20
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:07,120
Xiaobei,

21
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,960
this is the terrorist

22
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,000
who actually claimed responsibility

23
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,120
for the Silent Protectors bombing.

24
00:04:18,759 --> 00:04:20,600
I knew Hades was behind this all along,

25
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:22,319
but I didn't expect...

26
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:25,000
I didn't expect him to be this hard to deal with.

27
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,600
This attack on the Silent Protectors base

28
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:30,759
only highlights how severely

29
00:04:30,759 --> 00:04:32,360
the local anti-government forces disrupt security.

30
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,279
Exactly.

31
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,279
Besides, Hades is definitely not

32
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,920
just an ordinary militant leader.

33
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,720
His terrorist organization

34
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,160
has likely already infiltrated

35
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,519
several neighboring countries.

36
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,160
What's more,

37
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:46,399
he's backed by Deep Sea,

38
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,920
which grants him substantial

39
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,160
political resources.

40
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:51,759
So this isn't just against the Silent Protectors,

41
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,600
it's a direct provocation against Zhong An

42
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,120
and the entire Chinese community.

43
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,800
We must stay in touch with the Silent Protectors

44
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,000
and be ready to cooperate.

45
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,199
Don't forget,

46
00:05:00,759 --> 00:05:01,959
he still owes us.

47
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,560
What did you pick up?

48
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,600
It looks like

49
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:30,279
a chip from a tracker.

50
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,199
Really?

51
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:34,160
They probably used it on Qin Huan and the others

52
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,120
to track their targets.

53
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,600
Can you use this

54
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,319
to find their hideout?

55
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,839
I'm not sure if it's intact yet,

56
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:44,959
but I can give it a try.

57
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
What's the situation?

58
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:36,920
Where's Sha Lan?

59
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,800
Sha Lan found a chip.

60
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,680
She said Hades planted it on Qin Huan.

61
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:47,319
Based on the tracker's

62
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:49,199
logs with the main server,

63
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:49,879
I've already confirmed

64
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:51,240
Hades' location a few hours ago

65
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,879
in Antilocaris.

66
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:54,720
But...

67
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,959
But what?

68
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,600
But I made a mistake.

69
00:06:57,839 --> 00:06:59,920
The tracker is a spy device.

70
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,519
Once connected to our computer,

71
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,759
it automatically steals

72
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,319
all of our client data.

73
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,319
And it's already been sent to Hades.

74
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,639
Damn it!

75
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:13,199
Our data is encrypted,

76
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:16,120
but given enough time, they'll crack it.

77
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,279
Then our client data will be leaked.

78
00:07:22,279 --> 00:07:23,800
Could this be a trap?

79
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,680
A trap?

80
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:30,079
For instance,

81
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,680
Hades knows

82
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,360
this data is vital to us.

83
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,160
On one hand,

84
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,879
he steals our data,

85
00:07:35,959 --> 00:07:36,959
and on the other,

86
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,519
he sets a trap to lure us there.

87
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,399
Killing two birds with one stone.

88
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,600
Looks like this time,

89
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:44,759
we have no choice but to go after him.

90
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,160
There's no other way.

91
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,199
We must retrieve that data.

92
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:51,079
Otherwise, our clients

93
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,560
will be in deep trouble.

94
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,120
Sha Lan!

95
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,399
Damn it!

96
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,320
Boss, our network's being jammed.

97
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,919
The surveillance cameras suddenly went down.

98
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:08,679
I'll go find out why right away.

99
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,200
Alright, go, go, go!

100
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,080
Yes, sir.

101
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:27,720
Little kitten, you finally showed up.

102
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,480
I've been waiting for you for so long.

103
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,279
Wei Tian.

104
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:34,919
This man is about to disappear from your life.

105
00:09:44,799 --> 00:09:46,120
Sha Lan has already stopped.

106
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:48,919
Rosie, can you speed up?

107
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:52,120
That's the first time you've ever said I drive too slow.

108
00:10:58,559 --> 00:11:00,080
Drop what's in your hands.

109
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,879
How did you know I got in here?

110
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:06,000
The internet isn't the only way to transmit video.

111
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:09,120
The types of signals a jammer can block

112
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,360
are limited, too.

113
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:13,279
You should know that better than I do.

114
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:17,600
So you stole all our client data

115
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:19,960
just to lure me here.

116
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:23,519
This is one of your drug labs.

117
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,080
What do you want?

118
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,200
It's actually quite simple.

119
00:11:30,639 --> 00:11:33,000
Wei Tian will be here soon.

120
00:11:34,279 --> 00:11:35,360
I want him

121
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,120
to watch you slowly die.

122
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,360
Rosie, be careful.

123
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,480
Back us up right here.

124
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:54,879
Let's go.

125
00:11:54,879 --> 00:11:55,519
Got it.

126
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:37,919
Wei Tian, just to torture you,

127
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:40,919
I don't mind the cost of a bomb.

128
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,519
Because I've found

129
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,919
torturing you slowly is far more fun.

130
00:13:45,559 --> 00:13:47,919
There are only three Silent Protectors left now,

131
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:50,519
so I still have three more chances.

132
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:53,360
The game is about to get much more thrilling.

133
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:56,320
By the way, in Antilocaris,

134
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,919
you still have a little friend.

135
00:13:58,759 --> 00:14:00,200
I almost forgot.

136
00:14:06,039 --> 00:14:06,840
Wei Tian,

137
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:10,360
you must learn to savor grief slowly.

138
00:14:10,879 --> 00:14:13,919
Don't be in such a rush to cry all your tears out.

139
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,559
After death,

140
00:14:26,919 --> 00:14:29,159
even the air smells sweet.

141
00:14:58,919 --> 00:15:01,720
Antilocaris. Here's your passport.

142
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:07,200
I... for all these years,

143
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,519
I haven't had any family around.

144
00:15:08,519 --> 00:15:09,799
It's just been you.

145
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,360
I've never even had an identity.

146
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,240
So...

147
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:16,080
does this mean I finally have one?

148
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,759
O-Of course.

149
00:15:21,919 --> 00:15:24,399
Sticking with you really does have a future.

150
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,080
One lemon.

151
00:15:47,759 --> 00:15:49,279
My grip's been a bit weak lately.

152
00:15:49,639 --> 00:15:50,720
Need to work out more.

153
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:09,120
This coffee tastes so weird.

154
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:12,799
There are grounds in it, and it's so thick.

155
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:13,879
And it's so bitter.

156
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:18,360
Will we ever see each other again?

157
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:46,600
Are you really disbanding the Silent Protectors?

158
00:16:51,639 --> 00:16:52,720
You promised me

159
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:57,159
you'd have the Silent Protectors join Zhong An.

160
00:16:57,639 --> 00:17:00,480
You're not backing out on me now, are you?

161
00:17:00,759 --> 00:17:02,559
When have I ever broken a promise to you?

162
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,599
So that means you agree.

163
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,440
That's great!

164
00:17:10,519 --> 00:17:12,279
I'll book three more tickets right away.

165
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,079
We can all go back together.

166
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,480
Two will be enough.

167
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:20,599
Let Rosie and Captain go with you.

168
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:21,400
What about you?

169
00:17:24,359 --> 00:17:25,400
I want to stay.

170
00:17:25,759 --> 00:17:26,559
Wei Tian...

171
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,319
Don't act on impulse.

172
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,599
Sha Lan, my family...

173
00:17:34,799 --> 00:17:35,599
Xiang Lai...

174
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,920
they're all gone now.

175
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,680
I don't want anyone else

176
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,880
dragged into danger because of me.

177
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,519
As soon as

178
00:17:48,799 --> 00:17:50,319
I take down Hades,

179
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,920
I'll come back to find you.

180
00:17:54,839 --> 00:17:57,960
For now, the Silent Protectors must disappear.

181
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,359
Sha Lan is gone.

182
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,720
The base is destroyed.

183
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,880
It's time for us to start a new life, too.

184
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:25,920
I spoke to Xiang Pingsheng,

185
00:18:26,279 --> 00:18:27,200
and he agreed

186
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,799
to let you join Zhong An anytime.

187
00:18:32,519 --> 00:18:33,880
But whether you want to join or not,

188
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:37,160
you can decide for yourselves.

189
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,680
If you need us,

190
00:18:56,319 --> 00:18:58,079
you know where to find me.

191
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:15,079
Anda.

192
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:18,799
Where are you going?

193
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,440
I...

194
00:19:20,599 --> 00:19:22,519
I've been trying to reach Wei Tian all day,

195
00:19:22,519 --> 00:19:23,720
but I can't get through to him.

196
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,119
I'm going to check on him.

197
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:26,119
Don't go.

198
00:19:27,279 --> 00:19:28,079
What happened to him?

199
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:31,519
Wei Tian's fine. It's Sha Lan.

200
00:19:32,079 --> 00:19:33,079
What happened to Sha Lan?

201
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,200
She's dead.

202
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,000
Was it Hades?

203
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,039
No.

204
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:50,240
Anda.

205
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,160
Wei Tian, where are you?

206
00:19:56,319 --> 00:19:57,119
Where are you?

207
00:19:57,799 --> 00:19:59,599
I just left the hotel. I need to see you.

208
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,680
I'll come pick you up.

209
00:20:26,519 --> 00:20:27,319
Get in the car.

210
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,079
I'm not going back.

211
00:20:39,039 --> 00:20:40,200
Hades hasn't been caught yet.

212
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,920
The Silent Protectors base was utterly destroyed.

213
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,160
If I go back now,

214
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:44,400
will you really feel at ease about the clients here?

215
00:20:46,039 --> 00:20:48,880
But Wei Tian said he can't guarantee your safety.

216
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,480
Come on, Dad.

217
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,680
I know you're worried about my safety,

218
00:20:53,319 --> 00:20:54,920
but we have so many Zhong An people here.

219
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,359
Like Uncle Wei Tian,

220
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:57,680
Qu Shengli, Ye Wan...

221
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:59,440
With so many of us, we can look out for each other.

222
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,079
The Silent Protectors have already been disbanded.

223
00:21:01,920 --> 00:21:02,720
What did you say?

224
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,680
They're disbanded?

225
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:08,200
Wei Tian has already told Rosie and Qu Shengli

226
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:09,319
to head back home.

227
00:21:10,599 --> 00:21:11,680
I have a mission for you.

228
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,160
Go... Go ahead.

229
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:18,119
Go back home and get in touch with them.

230
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:21,599
Convince them to join Zhong An.

231
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:22,720
Yes, sir.

232
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:24,799
But...

233
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,200
Is this mission that hard?

234
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,960
Not hard. I guarantee I'll get it done.

235
00:21:31,119 --> 00:21:31,880
Then go.

236
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:32,519
Yes, sir.

237
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:37,519
Go on.

238
00:21:46,279 --> 00:21:47,400
Tell me what's on your mind.

239
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:54,880
Wei Tian, I know you're hurting.

240
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,920
Just let it all out.

241
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:04,359
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

242
00:22:05,359 --> 00:22:06,160
Wait, no...

243
00:22:06,160 --> 00:22:08,519
What... What are you talking about?

244
00:22:12,119 --> 00:22:13,200
If you stay by my side,

245
00:22:14,359 --> 00:22:15,680
at any moment, you could be

246
00:22:16,519 --> 00:22:17,599
in mortal danger.

247
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:23,359
That's why I have you to protect me!

248
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:24,920
Then... then it won't be dangerous.

249
00:22:25,839 --> 00:22:27,079
How can I protect you?

250
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:30,119
I couldn't even protect Sha Lan.

251
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:32,680
I'm completely incapable of protecting you.

252
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:37,079
You managed to pull me

253
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,960
out of Hades' clutches.

254
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,519
You can protect me!

255
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:43,359
You were just lucky last time.

256
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:50,319
If worst comes to worst, I...

257
00:22:50,319 --> 00:22:51,519
Anda, listen to me.

258
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:54,680
I still have things I need to deal with.

259
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,319
Following me

260
00:22:59,119 --> 00:23:00,519
won't do you any good.

261
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,039
But...

262
00:23:06,559 --> 00:23:09,079
But I don't see it that way.

263
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:42,559
The number you dialed is not answering right now.

264
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,200
Please try again later.

265
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,440
Hello.

266
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:48,680
Cheers.

267
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,400
Cheers.

268
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:54,960
Excuse me, I'll be right back.

269
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:55,680
Sure.

270
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,880
What are you doing here?

271
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:06,319
Grace, have you...

272
00:25:06,759 --> 00:25:08,799
Have you seen Wei Tian lately?

273
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:13,000
I've been looking for him for days,

274
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:14,279
and I can't find him anywhere.

275
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:15,720
No, I haven't.

276
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:17,400
I haven't been in touch with him for a while.

277
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,799
If I knew where he was,

278
00:25:19,799 --> 00:25:20,880
I'd tell you.

279
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:28,680
Wei Tian told me before

280
00:25:29,039 --> 00:25:30,519
that in Antilocaris,

281
00:25:31,160 --> 00:25:32,519
if anything happened,

282
00:25:32,759 --> 00:25:34,319
I could come straight to you,

283
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,920
and that you'd definitely help.

284
00:25:37,559 --> 00:25:38,480
But now,

285
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:42,400
even you don't know where he is,

286
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:44,119
and there's no word from him.

287
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:48,000
I just don't know...

288
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,000
Don't be like this.

289
00:25:58,720 --> 00:25:59,880
You have to trust Wei Tian.

290
00:26:00,079 --> 00:26:01,200
He'll be fine.

291
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,519
Don't be sad.

292
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:26,640
Anda was born on March 9, 1993.

293
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,839
Blood type O, Pisces, 25 years old.

294
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,759
Transferred here in 2018.

295
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:31,720
Wei Tian.

296
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,319
Isn't she the one from your last mission,

297
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:34,599
that stupid woman you saved?

298
00:26:35,559 --> 00:26:37,279
H-How can you talk like that?

299
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:45,720
Th-This is dangerous, you know?

300
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:47,119
It almost hit my head!

301
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:49,519
If it hit you, it's your own fault.

302
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:51,119
Just be careful next time.

303
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:11,880
Do you know how important

304
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,880
these dolls are to me?

305
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:13,920
Sha Lan.

306
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:16,079
This is for you,

307
00:27:16,079 --> 00:27:17,519
your favorite doll.

308
00:27:21,079 --> 00:27:22,160
Who wants your doll?

309
00:27:25,240 --> 00:27:26,039
Sha Lan.

310
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:30,920
This is... your favorite doll.

311
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,279
Every year from now on,

312
00:27:34,359 --> 00:27:35,960
I'll come and bring you one.

313
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:45,599
I can't find Wei Tian anymore.

314
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:51,119
I hope you can watch over him.

315
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,079
The Silent Protectors have disbanded.

316
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,119
Didn't Wei Tian tell you?

317
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:02,680
No.

318
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:04,680
I've completely lost touch with him.

319
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,480
Why would he do that?

320
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,400
I don't believe it.

321
00:28:08,359 --> 00:28:09,880
Everything happens for a reason.

322
00:28:10,559 --> 00:28:12,079
Nobody wants to bring danger

323
00:28:12,079 --> 00:28:13,720
to the people around them.

324
00:28:13,759 --> 00:28:14,880
What's danger to you?

325
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,720
Aren't you the ones who overcome it?

326
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:17,759
You only live once,

327
00:28:17,759 --> 00:28:19,279
but danger comes time and again.

328
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:28,559
Why not consider returning home with me?

329
00:28:28,799 --> 00:28:30,359
You aren't happy staying here anyway.

330
00:28:32,359 --> 00:28:33,519
You're going back?

331
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,880
My dad wants me to

332
00:28:36,079 --> 00:28:37,880
prepare for taking in the Silent Protectors.

333
00:28:38,640 --> 00:28:40,720
The Silent Protectors are joining Zhong An?

334
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:43,119
To be precise,

335
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:45,480
once Rosie and Captain return home,

336
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:46,960
they might join Zhong An.

337
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:50,279
Is Zhong An hiring right now?

338
00:28:50,279 --> 00:28:51,039
Yes.

339
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,000
At our Shenzhen headquarters.

340
00:28:53,119 --> 00:28:54,599
We hold recruitment evaluations every year.

341
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:57,279
That's great.

342
00:28:59,119 --> 00:29:00,720
What do you think, Anda? Consider it.

343
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:01,799
Come back home with me.

344
00:29:03,079 --> 00:29:03,920
Yeah, Anda.

345
00:29:05,039 --> 00:29:06,119
Let me think about it.

346
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:07,920
Let me tell you,

347
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,039
the best way to forget someone

348
00:29:10,039 --> 00:29:12,079
is to leave the city where he lives.

349
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:37,599
Child.

350
00:29:48,920 --> 00:29:53,079
Wei Tian, you must learn to savor grief slowly.

351
00:29:53,079 --> 00:29:54,519
Don't be in such a rush

352
00:29:54,839 --> 00:29:56,400
to cry all your tears out.

353
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,720
Anda.

354
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:07,920
What's going on?

355
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:09,680
Housekeeping

356
00:31:09,680 --> 00:31:11,519
got three complaints this month.

357
00:31:11,519 --> 00:31:13,480
They're all from guests reporting

358
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:16,079
that your rooms are dirty and below hygiene standards.

359
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:22,960
I'm talking to you!

360
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:27,680
Mr. Xiao.

361
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:30,519
I want to apply to go back home.

362
00:31:31,839 --> 00:31:32,640
Go back home?

363
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:47,680
Captain, are we just heading back like this?

364
00:31:48,759 --> 00:31:49,599
I'm worried.

365
00:31:50,119 --> 00:31:51,720
It's not safe for Wei Tian to be here alone.

366
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:57,960
Let's head back first.

367
00:31:59,119 --> 00:32:00,519
So he doesn't have to worry about us.

368
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,039
Let's go.

369
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,599
Have you ever heard

370
00:33:14,599 --> 00:33:17,559
about the hotel hostage crisis last time?

371
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:20,160
That was all thanks to the Silent Protectors.

372
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,480
According to the hostages,

373
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:25,200
the police at that time

374
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,519
were helpless against the criminals.

375
00:33:26,519 --> 00:33:27,279
Right at that moment,

376
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:29,599
this super handsome guy suddenly showed up,

377
00:33:29,599 --> 00:33:30,759
grabbed a dinner knife,

378
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,599
and just like that,

379
00:33:33,839 --> 00:33:36,079
he took down the criminals.

380
00:33:36,279 --> 00:33:37,279
You don't need to be afraid.

381
00:33:37,559 --> 00:33:40,160
The Silent Protectors have my shop covered.

382
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:42,359
If you run into any trouble, just let me know.

383
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:44,240
I'll contact the Silent Protectors for you

384
00:33:44,240 --> 00:33:45,519
and get them to help you.

385
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:47,519
I've been sitting here for so long,

386
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:49,759
yet you haven't sold a single bowl of beef noodles.

387
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:52,160
Instead of spreading your culinary craft here,

388
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,359
why don't you just go back home?

389
00:33:53,519 --> 00:33:54,599
That's where you're wrong.

390
00:33:54,960 --> 00:33:56,599
A real man sets his sights on the world.

391
00:33:57,000 --> 00:33:58,079
Selling beef noodles here

392
00:33:58,079 --> 00:33:59,200
isn't about making money.

393
00:33:59,759 --> 00:34:01,599
It's about serving dreamers like you

394
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,599
a comforting bowl of home.

395
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:24,559
Mine is a bear.

396
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,320
Anda's got some real skill.

397
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,280
Mine is a cat.

398
00:35:29,519 --> 00:35:30,280
Anda,

399
00:35:30,559 --> 00:35:31,639
you made each one of us

400
00:35:31,639 --> 00:35:32,880
a badge.

401
00:35:33,079 --> 00:35:34,159
Does each animal

402
00:35:34,159 --> 00:35:35,599
have a different meaning?

403
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:40,400
Uncle Qu is like a bear, full of strength.

404
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:43,360
Sister Rosie is like a cat,

405
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:44,920
so elegant and beautiful.

406
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:47,159
As for Sha Lan, she's like a fawn,

407
00:35:47,159 --> 00:35:47,960
so cute.

408
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:49,239
Thank you.

409
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:52,280
Even Sha Lan said thank you.

410
00:36:28,239 --> 00:36:29,039
Anda.

411
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:34,519
Anda, what's going on with you?

412
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,880
Were you really planning to slip away quietly,

413
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:39,159
without letting us see you off

414
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,800
or throwing you a farewell party?

415
00:36:41,639 --> 00:36:43,079
Do we even have the budget for that?

416
00:36:45,039 --> 00:36:45,840
Come on, stop.

417
00:36:46,079 --> 00:36:47,119
Stop laughing, everyone.

418
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:50,519
Worst case, I can pay for it myself.

419
00:36:50,639 --> 00:36:51,960
Then again,

420
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:53,639
whether we have a ceremony or not

421
00:36:53,639 --> 00:36:55,280
isn't really that important.

422
00:36:56,039 --> 00:36:56,880
Anda...

423
00:37:03,679 --> 00:37:05,679
Anda, honestly,

424
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:07,920
we're really going to miss you.

425
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:10,519
Come back whenever you miss us.

426
00:37:11,119 --> 00:37:11,920
Remember,

427
00:37:12,119 --> 00:37:14,559
this will always be your home overseas.

428
00:37:25,239 --> 00:37:27,719
I'm off. My time is up.

429
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:31,280
I'm leaving.

430
00:37:37,079 --> 00:37:37,760
Safe travels.

431
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:38,320
Stay safe.

432
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:39,079
Be careful.

433
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,760
Welcome, ma'am.

434
00:37:43,760 --> 00:37:45,079
How may I help you?

435
00:37:45,199 --> 00:37:46,679
I promise that starting today,

436
00:37:46,679 --> 00:37:48,519
this hotel will see big changes.

437
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:55,599
Everything is fine here.

438
00:37:55,599 --> 00:37:56,239
Come on.

439
00:37:59,679 --> 00:38:01,599
Hurry, get up there.

440
00:38:01,719 --> 00:38:02,519
Get in the car.

441
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:03,800
Hurry!

442
00:38:06,039 --> 00:38:07,119
My name is Erika.

443
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:09,320
Get the Silent Protectors to save my sisters.

444
00:38:21,119 --> 00:38:22,960
It's so good to see you.

445
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:25,000
It really is.

446
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:27,800
Thank you. Thank you.

447
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:29,519
You saved my sisters.

448
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:31,079
I'm so grateful to you.

449
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,920
Thank you so much, really.

450
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:47,360
Anda, don't be afraid.

451
00:38:48,159 --> 00:38:49,000
I'm with you.

452
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:58,679
Hello.

453
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:00,159
Don't tell me...

454
00:39:00,159 --> 00:39:01,519
you're here to see us off.

455
00:39:02,559 --> 00:39:03,760
Are you really going back home?

456
00:39:04,639 --> 00:39:05,760
I've made up my mind.

457
00:39:06,159 --> 00:39:07,960
We're even on the same flight.

458
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:11,519
Sister Rosie, Uncle Qu...

459
00:39:11,679 --> 00:39:13,599
are you two coming back?

460
00:39:17,719 --> 00:39:19,119
We'll definitely come back.

461
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:23,679
Then goodbye, Antilocaris.

462
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:24,679
Let's go.

463
00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:25,199
Let's go. Okay.

464
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:25,880
Let's go.

465
00:40:34,519 --> 00:40:35,320
This is for you.

466
00:40:36,039 --> 00:40:37,119
Am I really that fierce?

467
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:40,480
Hurting living creatures doesn't seem like you.

468
00:40:41,920 --> 00:40:43,559
Eagles are the rulers of the sky.

469
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:46,000
I'm not that overbearing.

470
00:40:47,559 --> 00:40:49,400
Yet it always has this...

471
00:40:49,719 --> 00:40:51,159
...aloof air about it.

472
00:40:52,719 --> 00:40:53,800
It has weaknesses too.

473
00:40:54,199 --> 00:40:55,199
Do you have weaknesses?

474
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:56,079
I do.

475
00:40:56,679 --> 00:40:57,960
I do, and you do.

476
00:40:58,519 --> 00:40:59,519
Everyone does.

477
00:41:01,400 --> 00:41:04,519
But whenever you save people, you seem fearless.

478
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:09,519
Saving people is what scares me the most.

479
00:41:10,519 --> 00:41:11,320
Why?

480
00:41:11,599 --> 00:41:13,119
The more you want to protect someone,

481
00:41:13,559 --> 00:41:15,639
the greater the chance

482
00:41:15,639 --> 00:41:16,599
they'll end up getting hurt.

483
00:41:20,719 --> 00:41:21,679
I don't know about others,

484
00:41:21,679 --> 00:41:22,440
but...

485
00:41:23,719 --> 00:41:25,400
...you have to protect me.

486
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:28,320
Not protecting me would hurt me the most.

487
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:30,559
Here, this is for you.

488
00:41:35,280 --> 00:41:36,079
We're even.

489
00:41:37,079 --> 00:41:37,920
We're even.

490
00:42:25,039 --> 00:42:26,199
Let's get something to drink later.

491
00:42:26,199 --> 00:42:26,760
Sounds good.

492
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,519
Anda's back.

493
00:42:28,519 --> 00:42:29,719
Anda, long time no see.

494
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:31,320
Anda, back from Africa?

495
00:42:31,840 --> 00:42:32,639
Yeah, I'm back.

496
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:49,119
Anda, here's your new ID badge.

497
00:42:52,440 --> 00:42:53,519
Starting today,

498
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:56,679
you're Mr. Dan's special assistant.

499
00:42:56,960 --> 00:42:57,760
Congratulations.

500
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:02,920
I thought she was only sent to Africa last year.

501
00:43:02,920 --> 00:43:04,320
How'd she get transferred back so fast?

502
00:43:04,599 --> 00:43:06,280
Right? And she even got promoted.

503
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:07,320
Tell me about it.

504
00:43:08,159 --> 00:43:10,559
She must've cozied up to some higher-up in the company.

505
00:43:11,960 --> 00:43:12,880
Makes sense.

506
00:43:13,039 --> 00:43:15,199
What's with the chatter? Don't you have work to do?

507
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:23,719
Anda.

508
00:43:24,519 --> 00:43:25,679
Let's grab dinner tonight.

509
00:43:26,000 --> 00:43:27,599
That new Japanese place downstairs is pretty good.

510
00:43:27,599 --> 00:43:28,679
We should definitely check it out.

511
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:31,880
Now get back to work.
